  "VbaCode": "CodeBehindForm\r\nAttribute VB_GlobalNameSpace = False\r\nAttribute VB_Creatable = True\r\nAttribute VB_PredeclaredId = True\r\nAttribute VB_Exposed = False\r\nOption Compare Database\r\nOption Explicit\r\nPrivate Sub Detail_Format(Cancel As Integer, FormatCount As Integer)\r\n    \u0027 Color-code priority: red=1, orange=2-3, white=4\u002B\r\n    Select Case Nz(Me.txtPriority, 99)\r\n        Case 1\r\n            Me.Section(0).BackColor = 255  \u0027 Red\r\n        Case 2, 3\r\n            Me.Section(0).BackColor = 33023  \u0027 Orange\r\n        Case Else\r\n            Me.Section(0).BackColor = 16777215  \u0027 White\r\n    End Select\r\nEnd Sub\r\n",
